  m_text: "As an Astronomer at Starlight Observatory, your job is to find as many
    constellations as you can before the sun rises! \n\nWith your trusty ol' telescope,
    move your mouse around the window and click each star that's part of the constellation
    shown in the Constellation Card. \n\nYou have to find the exact constellation
    to progress, so if you accidentally select some stars, you can right click them
    to deselect as needed.\n\nIf you need some help pinpointing the location of constellations,
    press Tab to open and close a star chart."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 16e62aab70e149449b8e9c2adbe75af7, type: 2}
